.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH SSGRID 1 2000-1月 "sfit" "sfit"
.SH NAME
sfit \- infer the S-system gene regulatory network from the gene expression matrix
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIsfit(\fBx\fR as <generic> Matrix, 
\fBopts\fR as <generic> FittingOptions = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
\fBprior\fR as any = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
\fBtime\fR as any = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
infer the S-system gene regulatory network from the gene expression matrix
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBx\fB \fR\- 
 the gene expression matrix(rows are genes and columns are the time points), 
 this matrix object could be loaded from a csv file via \fBgeneExpression::load.expr\fR.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBopts\fB \fR\- the fitting configuration object, see also: [ssGrid.sfitOptions()](cref:M:biosystem.ssGrid.sfitOptions(System.String,System.Double,System.Double,System.Int32,System.Int32,System.Double,System.Double,System.Int32,System.Double,System.Double,System.Double,SMRUCC.genomics.BioSystem.Core.PriorNetwork,System.Int32,System.Int32,System.Int32,System.Boolean,System.Boolean,System.Boolean,System.Double,System.Double,System.Int32,System.Int32)).. 
.PP
.PP
\fBprior\fB \fR\- 
 the prior knowledge regulatory network, which could be a 
 [PriorNetwork](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.BioSystem.Core.PriorNetwork) object(from \fBbnlearn::as.prior_net\fR or \fBsgrid_prior\fR) 
 or a csv file path. This prior is used as a **soft** constraint: an interaction 
 that is not supported by the prior will be shrunk, but a new regulation 
 relation could still be discovered from the expression data.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBtime\fB \fR\- the time points of the matrix columns, a numeric vector.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [SSystemNetwork](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.SGrid.GRN.SSystemNetwork) object that contains the fitted network 
 topology and the kinetic parameters; a R# error message object will be 
 returned if the input data is not valid.
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
let opts = sfit_options(sparsity = 0.01, max_edges = 6, smooth = 9);
 let network = sfit(x, opts, prior = as.prior_net(prior_edges), time = t);
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
ssGrid
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
